# Root Docker build-context ignore.
#
# agents-service (deployments/docker-compose.yml) is the one image built with
# the REPO ROOT as context — it needs sibling workspace packages
# (packages/excalidraw-dsl, packages/design-projection) alongside
# components/dataplane/ae-system-project/ae-studio/ae-design-agent, which live
# outside that package's own directory. See
# components/dataplane/ae-system-project/ae-studio/ae-design-agent/Dockerfile.
# Every other image (aep-api, console, the local
# stub services) builds from a narrower per-service context and never sees
# this file, so entries here only need to keep the root build sane.
#
# Mirrors .gitignore's build-artifact set — none of this is needed inside the
# image; the Dockerfile builds workspace deps from source.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
generated
**/generated
*.gen.go
*.gen.ts

# VCS / editor / OS cruft.
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log

# Secrets — never bake these into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dev-only scratch (components/dataplane/ae-system-project/ae-studio/ae-design-agent playground threads; not part of the image).
chat_playground
**/chat_playground
